async function api(path,options={}){const target=requestTarget(path,options),authHeaders=ownerMode?{'X-Ohm-Auth-Provider':'chatgpt'}:auth&&usesAccountAuth(path,options)?await auth.headers():{};const init=requestOptions(path,options,authHeaders);if(!uiReady&&(!init.method||init.method==='GET')&&!init.signal)init.signal=AbortSignal.timeout(15000);let response;try{response=await fetch(target,init);}catch(e){if(e.name==='TimeoutError'||e.name==='AbortError')throw new Error('The connection is taking longer than expected. Please try again.');throw e;}let data;try{data=await response.json()}catch{throw new Error('The server could not complete the request. Please try again.')}if(!response.ok){const error=new Error(data.error||'The request failed.');error.status=response.status;error.data=data;throw error;}return data;}
